      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ترمّق</span></b>  <i>He drank milk little by little.</i> (K.
[See also 2.]) And <i>He supped,</i> or <i>sipped,</i> water,
(S, K,) &amp;c., <i>sup after sup,</i> or <i>sip after sip.</i> (K.)

